[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Open the rear door and undo the retaining bolts inside the handle.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005167.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Move the handle slightly and release lever (1a) from link (1b).</p><p>2. Recover the outer handle.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005168.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the outer handle\nis undamaged.</p><p>Connect the lever to the link.</p><p>Place the handle in position and secure\nit using the bolts.</p>"]]